#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1393
msgid "Cross checks GitHub for newer ones."
msgstr "Crucea caută pe GitHub unele mai noi."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1394
msgid "Community graphic packs for Wii U games, downloaded from GitHub. They download in the background the first time the Wii U opens."
